Subject: Backport net-imap 0.4 command checks onto 0.3.10

Ruby 3.2 bundles net-imap 0.3.9. The 0.5.15 gem changes header field quoting, replaces MessageSet with SequenceSet, and deletes client_thread plus the BodyType structs. These checks keep the 0.3 calling convention and reject the command-smuggling inputs fixed on the 0.4 line.

Origin: backport, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/bfdae2143caac77d506f5af93213d17b1f96bb30, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/bbd9eb7ecca506fa43b656368f7aebef8ac09182, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/a3c3d7f5baa4a4d84802e3227373f2a20b61ccc7, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/d2b23602e8617311900a9b3acf0c8d708b70bad4, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/6dd110bfda6b47da9c294791ef16911bd1f49033, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/892da94f5c6034028a3aabf27d5981bd41be249c, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/7449e180ad6d4211624b7e25138d0b17a86da0fc, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/7228b22b81a49198172fb111a343fef80236bbf5, https://github.com/ruby/net-imap/commit/2922a38fdaea440009c14642e00e39c5eec48582
CVE: CVE-2026-42245
CVE: CVE-2026-42257
CVE: CVE-2026-42258
CVE: CVE-2026-47240
CVE: CVE-2026-47241
CVE: CVE-2026-47242
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/ruby/net-imap.git ec89812d3c986d6394d3bc0b93048e704aec6af9
Adaptation: ResponseReader scans the latest line only, matching bfdae2143c, and does not keep the unreachable duplicate done? definition left in the 0.4.24 file. Symbol checks follow bbd9eb7ecca for atom specials and 2922a38fdae for the empty-flag rejection. STORE attr atoms, SETQUOTA Integer limits, RawData literal parsing, the trailing continuation rejection, and quoted-string NULL/CR/LF rejection follow the cited commits. The 0.4 CommandData class split is not imported, so MessageSet remains and RawData send_data is still one put_string after validation. Non-synchronizing "{n+}" markers inside RawData are rejected instead of the LITERAL+ and LITERAL- capability check in 7228b22b81, because 0.3 send_literal never writes them.
Verify: cmd `patch -p1 --dry-run --forward --input dhi-net-imap-0.3.10-command-validation.patch` expect "checking file lib/net/imap/command_data.rb"

